      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KILCOY MISSIE (7) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a nose (19.87) behind Zing Matilda at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Rates highly and will give a great sight. PEEPING PETE (1) isn't a quick beginner but comes home hard, finishing out of the frame two back but did wind up strongly to place when third (19.93) in a Grade 6 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Winning chance. JOSIE'S LANE (8) is progressing well scoring last time out (17.42) at Murray Bridge Straight and bringing up her 2nd career win. Expecting another bold showing. MCCRACKEN (4) looks a top-three chance while fresh.",
